# Weekly Write — IDE fallback

If `data/weekly-write-ide-brief.md` exists (awaiting IDE), or the user asks to draft/notify a weekly Write:

Follow the project skill **`weekly-write-essay`** (`.cursor/skills/weekly-write-essay/SKILL.md`).

Do not publish MDX yourself — Slack Approve in `#career-ops` commits via the normal pipeline.
